=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Rakuru-Rakoru} in {z:Lower Jeuno} (I-6) next to the fountain. He will ask you to defeat several {p:Notorious Monsters|Notorious Monster} (listed below) with the {@k} {k:Data Analyzer and Logger EX} in your possession.
** Once each NM is defeated you will receive the message: "The relevant battle data has been recorded in your Data Analyzer and Logger EX."
** {p:Nyzul Isle} variants **__DO NOT COUNT**__ towards completion of this quest.
* Speak with Rakuru-Rakoru at any time to check your progress.
* Once all the NM data has been recorded return to Rakuru-Rakoru for your reward.

|^Notorious Monster|Zone|Description
|{m:Tumbling Truffle}|{z:La Theine Plateau}|Tumbling Truffle is a creature from the funguar family. It's known to inhabitaru valley floors near the Crag of Holla, in the northeastern area of the La Theine Plateau.
|{m:Tottering Toby}|{z:Batallia Downs}|Tottering Toby is a creature from the sapling family. It's been observed around Coveffe Barrows, in the Batallia Downs.
|{m:Blubbery Bulge}|{z:Davoi}|Blubbery Bulge is a creature from the slime family. It's been observed around the Disused Well in the southwestern region of Davoi.
|{m:Black Triple Stars}|{z:Rolanberry Fields}|Black Triple Stars is a creature from the bat family. It's a known inhabitant of Brutus's Field in the Rolanberry Fields.
|{m:Drooling Daisy}|{z:Rolanberry Fields}|Drooling Daisy is a creature from the morbol family. It's been observed near the Fountain of Partings in the Rolanberry Fields.
|{m:Jolly Green}|{z:Pashhow Marshlands}|Jolly Green is a creature from the goobbue family. It's supposed to inhabitaru the Luremarsh area in the Pashhow Marshlands.
|{m:Sharp-Eared Ropipi}|{z:East Sarutabaruta}|Sharp-Eared Ropipi is a creature from the rabbit family. It inhabits the southeastern region of East Sarutabaruta.
|{m:Buburimboo}|{z:Buburimu Peninsula}|Buburimboo is a creature from the pugil family. It's a known inhabitant of the Mighoya Dunes in the Buburimu Peninsula.
|{m:Daggerclaw Dracos}|{z:Meriphataud Mountains}|Daggerclaw Dracos is a creature from the raptor family. It's been observed in the southeastern region of the Meriphataud Mountains.
|{m:Trickster Kinetix}|{z:Qufim Island}|Trickster Kinetix is a creature from the evil weapon family. It's been seen in the open area near Delkfutt's Tower on Qufim Island.
|{p:Ixtab|Ixtab (Monster)}|{z:Upper Delkfutt's Tower}|Ixtab is a creature from the ghost family. It supposedly dwells in one of the roomy-wooms inside Upper Delkfutt's Tower.
|{m:Gargantua}|{z:Beaucedine Glacier}|Gargantua is a creature from the golem family. It's a known inhabitant of the coastaru area in eastern Beaucedine Glacier.
|{m:Shadow Eye}|{z:Xarcabard}|Shadow Eye is a creature from the Ahriman family. It's been seen in western Xarcabard.
|{m:Boreal Coeurl}|{z:Xarcabard}|Boreal Coeurl is a creature from the coeurl family. It supposedly dwells inside a cavey-wave in the northeastern region of Xarcabard.
|{m:Boreal Hound}|{z:Xarcabard}|Boreal Hound is a creature from the hound family. It supposedly dwells inside a cavey-wave in the southwestern region of Xarcabard.
|{m:Boreal Tiger}|{z:Xarcabard}|Boreal Tiger is a creature from the tiger family. It supposedly dwells inside a cavey-wave in the northern region of Xarcabard.

=2 Notes
* The reward of 59630 gil: when these numbers are pronounced in Japanese, it says "gokurousama" which translates to "I appreciate the effort".

